  The reel_script opens by naming Kanchipuram as the place of the raids, but the article says the raids happen across Kanchipuram, Tiruvallur and Chengalpattu districts, with Kanchipuram being the main one (9 of 11). The tamil_headline and slides_spec also present Kanchipuram as the sole location in the caption/headline; the headline 'காஞ்சிபுரம்:' in the caption and slides_spec 'loc' overstate the location.
  The reel_script says the Kanchipuram regional manager and quality control officer were suspended, but the article only says they were already suspended; the draft's phrasing 'ஏற்கனவே சஸ்பெண்ட் செய்யப்பட்டுள்ளனர்' attributes the suspension to the complaint without support, and the slide 'மண்டல மேலாளர் சஸ்பெண்ட்' omits the quality control officer, which is a missing fact.
  The slide 'என்ன' (What) is an unclear heading that does not match its content, and the slide line 'நெல் அரிசியாக்கும் முறைகேடு புகாரில் சோதனை' is ungrammatical and mixes the raid and complaint into a garbled phrase.
  The reel_script states the raids are 'நடைபெறுகிறது' / 'நடக்கிறது' as ongoing; this matches the article, but the slide line 'பல கோடி ரூபாய் முறைகேடு என புகார்' is a fragment with no clear subject, making the claim unclear.
